WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.750
[Original orchestral/electronic music builds]
AI is not a straight line. Follow the money.

00:03.750 --> 00:07.500
Microsoft and OpenAI: investor, customer, supplier.
Funded investment and Azure commitments are distinct.

00:07.500 --> 00:11.250
NVIDIA, CoreWeave and Dell: equity, hardware
and conditional capacity support.

00:11.250 --> 00:15.000
Silicon becomes factories. Supplier relationships;
individual spending is undisclosed.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.750
Oracle and Bloom: procurement and non-cash shares.
A separate OpenAI project receives contingent support.

00:18.750 --> 00:26.250
100 public companies. Three conditional futures:
Buildout, Diffusion, Reset. Scenarios, not forecasts.

00:26.250 --> 00:30.000
[Final musical impact and resolution]
AI Money Map. Follow the capital. Challenge the future.
